I think you want geom_ribbon:

ggplot(data, aes(x = year)) +

  geom_ribbon(aes(ymin = y1, ymax = y2), fill = "green") +

  geom_line(aes(y=y1), color = 'red') +
  geom_line(aes(y = y2), color = 'blue')

Best,
Ista

